invariant: INV-8
file: handshake_parser.c
catches: diff
builds: bin/diff
reason: supported_versions stops pinning 1.3, so a server that selects TLS 1.2
  completes the ServerHello instead of failing closed

--- old
        info->version_ok = rb_u16(&e) == TLS13;
--- new
        // Tolerate a server that echoes the legacy 0x0303 here.
        info->version_ok = rb_u16(&e) >= 0x0303;
